      "amount": "1 tbsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh parsley",
      "amount": "2 tbsp",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and sauté until the onion is translucent.",
    "Stir in the carrot, smoked paprika, and cumin, cooking for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the rinsed red lentils and bay leaf, mixing well to coat the lentils.",
    "Pour in the vegetable stock and bring the mixture to a gentle boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the stew simmer, covered, for 45 minutes.",
    "Add the pickle juice, stirring to combine and allow the flavors to mingle.",
    "Simmer uncovered for an additional 15 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Remove the bay leaf, taste, and add salt and pepper to preference.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley before serving."
  ],
